# Per-build-id release-candidate evidence is gate review input
# (docs/09_BUILD_RUN_AND_RELEASE.md § release evidence). Without these negations a newly
# generated evidence file inside an already-tracked local-rc-* root is silently ignored,
# so `git add -A` leaves a clean status while a required gate artifact is missing from the
# commit. Transient scratch roots (source-only-*, ep03-local-*) and *.log stay ignored.
!artifacts/release-evidence/local-rc-*/
!artifacts/release-evidence/local-rc-*/*.md
!artifacts/release-evidence/local-rc-*/ui-snapshots/
!artifacts/release-evidence/local-rc-*/ui-snapshots/*.md
!artifacts/release-evidence/local-rc-*/ui-snapshots/*.png
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.dobbyplugin
*.dobbylicense
*.dobbyrecovery
*.dobbyrecoveryrequest
!tests/Dobby.IntegrationTests/Recovery/Fixtures/TEST-ONLY/*.dobbyrecovery
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.pem
*.key
# Public trust anchors are approved, version-controlled build input (ADR-0062 § 3).
# Private and TEST-ONLY key material stays ignored by the rules above.
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/vendor-plugin-package-public-key.pem
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/vendor-plugin-license-public-key.pem
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/vendor-recovery-public-key.pem
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/dev-qa-plugin-package-public-key.pem
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/dev-qa-plugin-license-public-key.pem
!src/Dobby.Host/Trust/dev-qa-recovery-public-key.pem
.worktrees/
worktrees/
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
*.log
*.tmp

